# who may do what (topics of line 1 and any later line under group3/dpx/)
# esp32: the board publishes data and its online / offline status
user esp32
topic readwrite group3/dpx/#

# web: the website and Telegraf only listen, so nobody with this password can fake data;
# the website may only set the products' routes (the board checks what it gets)
user web
topic read group3/dpx/#
topic write group3/dpx/+/route/set
# ...and send the control page's commands (website/control.html); only the hub writes the state itself
topic write group3/dpx/+/control/set

# hub: server/control-hub, the one copy of the control page's state
user hub
topic read group3/dpx/#
topic write group3/dpx/+/control
